<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Mo. convention center bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Mo. convention center bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for Missouri Convention and Sports Facility project and refunding bonds, series A 1993.</p>
<p>Capacity, initially limited to $20 million per firm, will be available on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
